The R program that I am working on calls several other open source software application installed in the user PCs and afterwards, it does the analysis.  We would like to create a GUI fort he R program using RStudio server and the Shiny package and host the application int he Shiny server afterwards.  We would like to keep the open source existing applications in the user PCs and let the R program hosted in the Shiny server call the applications installed in the PC.  Is this possible?

From u2674b6f8d9871f58 at groups.google.com  Fri Oct 20 16:22:11 2017
